# catalog/lane-run-inputs.d/stuck-work.ro — what one `bin/stuck-work.sh <p>`
# run reads and never writes back (BH-7423). The file:line after each entry is
# where the run reads it.
#
# bin/lib/stuck-work/facts-pr.sh:211-213, bin/lib/mc/classify.sh:1104,1146
# (FACTS field 15, the resolver's claim; the id is mc_handoff_id of <repo>#<n>)
state/merge-conductor/resolver-claim/$repokey_*
# bin/stuck-work.sh:106-116,153,256 (the home project, the project's repo)
fleet.conf
# bin/stuck-work.sh:257 (the ticket prefix of a non-home project; the lane
# image does not bake prompts/)
prompts/$p.md
# bin/stuck-work.sh:165,181, bin/lib/lane-gate.sh (the lane gate,
# flags/stuck-work-off, flags/lane-off-stuck-work)
flags/*
